# replay - px33b's test of a harp string plucked again while it rings
# (tests/mpx3-orchestra O4): one harp repeats D5 sixteen times in
# sixteenths and the bell repeats its G4 four times. Each is one string,
# one bell: struck in place, so the whole tune sounds 2 voices at most.
# Before px33b the harp took a new voice per pluck (17 at most).
title px33b replay
tempo 120
part hp harp mf
part gl bells mf
bar 1
hp  D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16 D5/16
gl  G4/4 G4/4 G4/4 G4/4
